
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Florence Blakeney.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Florence Blakeney.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"llf6b8","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777075206716,"size":4542,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"llf6b8"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,16],"#Characters - Florence Blakeney":[18,33],"#Characters - Florence Blakeney#{1}":[20,28],"#Characters - Florence Blakeney#{2}":[29,29],"#Characters - Florence Blakeney#{3}":[30,30],"#Characters - Florence Blakeney#{4}":[31,31],"#Characters - Florence Blakeney#{5}":[32,33]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":10,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Florence","Blakeney"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Florence Blakeney Selection Summary:**\n\n**What she is:** A 19-year-old Floran human (mixed Valheimr heritage), a nationally-ranked champion athlete who is also the Countess of Claymore Estate (by marriage). She is Charlotte's wife and the emotional core of their relationship, embodying warmth, playfulness, and empathetic loyalty—but is morally conflicted due to her submissive nature and guilt over their treatment of {{user}}.\n\n**When to select:** Select when the narrative involves emotional dynamics within the trio (Charlotte, Florence, {{user}}); scenes of domestic tension, moral conflict, or attempts at \"fair\" compensation; moments where someone mediates between Charlotte's cold pragmatism and {{user}}'s emotional needs; or any situation highlighting her competitive athletic public persona versus her private submissive role with Charlotte.\n\n**Key relationships:**\n- Charlotte (wife/dominant partner): Her primary relationship, to which she is utterly submissive despite her public athletic dominance\n- {{user}}: Object of her guilt and compensatory attempts at friendship and care\n- Father (Valheimr heritage): Influenced her athletic constitution\n- Sports world: Defines her public competitive identity"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Florence Blakeney.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1vquhcn","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Florence Blakeney.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,16],"size":1406,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
